@host = http://localhost:5179

### Health check
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Monthly income / expense / net trend (defaults to the last 12 months)
GET {{host}}/api/series/trend
Accept: application/json

### Cumulative balance within the reporting year
GET {{host}}/api/series/cumulative?grain=month
Accept: application/json

### Year-over-year comparison
GET {{host}}/api/series/yoy?years=2025,2026
Accept: application/json

### Reference data
GET {{host}}/api/reference/buckets
Accept: application/json

### Transactions still needing a bucket
GET {{host}}/api/transactions?unbucketed=true
Accept: application/json

### Trigger ingestion of the Raw Data Feed folders
POST {{host}}/api/ingest
